{"id":"607210","name":"番茄肉丸汤面","author":"Magic叮咚","authorId":"11490259","desc":"","cover":"images/607210/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"番茄","amount":"2个"},{"name":"肉馅","amount":"适量"},{"name":"挂面","amount":"适量"},{"name":"青菜","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱末","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜末","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1个"},{"name":"淀粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"番茄去皮切块。","img":"images/607210/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"油热，加入少许姜粒。","img":"images/607210/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入番茄炒至翻砂。","img":"images/607210/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加水和适量盐。","img":"images/607210/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"取适量肉馅，加入适量葱末、姜末、料酒、盐、胡椒粉、蛋清（或鸡蛋）、淀粉，顺一个方向搅拌上劲。","img":"images/607210/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"汤微开调小火，下丸子。","img":"images/607210/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"中火煮至肉丸熟透盛出。","img":"images/607210/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"锅中烧开水。","img":"images/607210/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"煮几片菜叶。","img":"images/607210/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"煮好菜叶捞出，煮面。","img":"images/607210/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"碗里盛入丸子汤。","img":"images/607210/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"面煮好和青菜一同放入碗里，放上肉丸即可。","img":"images/607210/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}